{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++11 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++11 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nconst int MAXN = 10000;\nconst int MAXM = 2000000;\nconst int INF = 0x3f3f3f3f;\n\nint n, m, k, c, d;\n\nstruct Edge {\n    int to, next, cap, flow, cost;\n} edge[MAXM];\nint head[MAXN], tol;\nint pre[MAXN], dis[MAXN];\nbool vis[MAXN];\nint N;\n\nvoid init(int n) {\n    N = n;\n    tol = 0;\n    memset(head, -1, sizeof(head));\n}\n\nvoid addedge(int u, int v, int cap, int cost) {\n    edge[tol].to = v;\n    edge[tol].cap = cap;\n    edge[tol].cost = cost;\n    edge[tol].flow = 0;\n    edge[tol].next = head[u];\n    head[u] = tol++;\n    edge[tol].to = u;\n    edge[tol].cap = 0;\n    edge[tol].cost = -cost;\n    edge[tol].flow = 0;\n    edge[tol].next = head[v];\n    head[v] = tol++;\n}\n\nbool spfa(int s, int t) {\n    queue<int> q;\n    for (int i = 0; i < N; ++i) {\n        dis[i] = INF;\n        vis[i] = false;\n        pre[i] = -1;\n    }\n    dis[s] = 0;\n    vis[s] = true;\n    q.push(s);\n    while (!q.empty()) {\n        int u = q.front(); q.pop();\n        vis[u] = false;\n        for (int i = head[u]; i != -1; i = edge[i].next) {\n            int v = edge[i].to;\n            if (edge[i].cap > edge[i].flow && dis[v] > dis[u] + edge[i].cost) {\n                dis[v] = dis[u] + edge[i].cost;\n                pre[v] = i;\n                if (!vis[v]) {\n                    vis[v] = true;\n                    q.push(v);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    return pre[t] != -1;\n}\n\nint minCostMaxflow(int s, int t, int& cost) {\n    int flow = 0;\n    cost = 0;\n    while (spfa(s, t)) {\n        int Min = INF;\n        for (int i = pre[t]; i != -1; i = pre[edge[i ^ 1].to]) {\n            Min = min(Min, edge[i].cap - edge[i].flow);\n        }\n        for (int i = pre[t]; i != -1; i = pre[edge[i ^ 1].to]) {\n            edge[i].flow += Min;\n            edge[i ^ 1].flow -= Min;\n            cost += edge[i].cost * Min;\n        }\n        flow += Min;\n    }\n    return flow;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    cin >> n >> m >> k >> c >> d;\n    init(MAXN);\n    for (int i = 0; i < k; ++i) {\n        int x;\n        cin >> x;\n        addedge(0, x, 1, 0);\n    }\n    for (int i = 0; i < 100; ++i) {\n        for (int j = 0; j < k; ++j) {\n            addedge(1 + i * n, 9999, 1, i * c);\n        }\n    }\n    for (int i = 0; i < m; ++i) {\n        int u, v;\n        cin >> u >> v;\n        for (int j = 1; j < 100; ++j) {\n            for (int gg = 1; gg <= k; ++gg) {\n                addedge(u + (j - 1) * n, v + j * n, 1, (2 * gg - 1) * d);\n                addedge(v + (j - 1) * n, u + j * n, 1, (2 * gg - 1) * d);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n        for (int j = 1; j < 100; ++j) {\n            addedge(i + (j - 1) * n, i + j * n, k, 0);\n        }\n    }\n    int cost;\n    minCostMaxflow(0, 9999, cost);\n    cout << cost << endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static final int MAXN = 10000;\n    static final int MAXM = 2000000;\n    static final int INF = 0x3f3f3f3f;\n\n    static int n, m, k, c, d;\n    static int[] head = new int[MAXN];\n    static int[] to = new int[MAXM];\n    static int[] next = new int[MAXM];\n    static int[] cap = new int[MAXM];\n    static int[] flow = new int[MAXM];\n    static int[] cost = new int[MAXM];\n    static int tol;\n    static int N;\n    static int[] pre = new int[MAXN];\n    static int[] dis = new int[MAXN];\n    static boolean[] vis = new boolean[MAXN];\n\n    static void init(int n) {\n        N = n;\n        tol = 0;\n        Arrays.fill(head, -1);\n    }\n\n    static void addedge(int u, int v, int cap, int cost) {\n        to[tol] = v;\n        cap[tol] = cap;\n        cost[tol] = cost;\n        flow[tol] = 0;\n        next[tol] = head[u];\n        head[u] = tol++;\n        to[tol] = u;\n        cap[tol] = 0;\n        cost[tol] = -cost;\n        flow[tol] = 0;\n        next[tol] = head[v];\n        head[v] = tol++;\n    }\n\n    static boolean spfa(int s, int t) {\n        Queue<Integer> q = new LinkedList<>();\n        Arrays.fill(dis, INF);\n        Arrays.fill(vis, false);\n        Arrays.fill(pre, -1);\n        dis[s] = 0;\n        vis[s] = true;\n        q.offer(s);\n        while (!q.isEmpty()) {\n            int u = q.poll();\n            vis[u] = false;\n            for (int i = head[u]; i != -1; i = next[i]) {\n                int v = to[i];\n                if (cap[i] > flow[i] && dis[v] > dis[u] + cost[i]) {\n                    dis[v] = dis[u] + cost[i];\n                    pre[v] = i;\n                    if (!vis[v]) {\n                        vis[v] = true;\n                        q.offer(v);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        return pre[t] != -1;\n    }\n\n    static int minCostMaxflow(int s, int t, int[] costRef) {\n        int flow = 0;\n        costRef[0] = 0;\n        while (spfa(s, t)) {\n            int Min = INF;\n            for (int i = pre[t]; i != -1; i = pre[to[i ^ 1]]) {\n                Min = Math.min(Min, cap[i] - flow[i]);\n            }\n            for (int i = pre[t]; i != -1; i = pre[to[i ^ 1]]) {\n                flow[i] += Min;\n                flow[i ^ 1] -= Min;\n                costRef[0] += cost[i] * Min;\n            }\n            flow += Min;\n        }\n        return flow;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        n = sc.nextInt();\n        m = sc.nextInt();\n        k = sc.nextInt();\n        c = sc.nextInt();\n        d = sc.nextInt();\n        init(MAXN);\n        for (int i = 0; i < k; ++i) {\n            int x = sc.nextInt();\n            addedge(0, x, 1, 0);\n        }\n        for (int i = 0; i < 100; ++i) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < k; ++j) {\n                addedge(1 + i * n, 9999, 1, i * c);\n            }\n        }\n        for (int i = 0; i < m; ++i) {\n            int u = sc.nextInt();\n            int v = sc.nextInt();\n            for (int j = 1; j < 100; ++j) {\n                for (int gg = 1; gg <= k; ++gg) {\n                    addedge(u + (j - 1) * n, v + j * n, 1, (2 * gg - 1) * d);\n                    addedge(v + (j - 1) * n, u + j * n, 1, (2 * gg - 1) * d);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n            for (int j = 1; j < 100; ++j) {\n                addedge(i + (j - 1) * n, i + j * n, k, 0);\n            }\n        }\n        int[] costRef = new int[1];\n        minCostMaxflow(0, 9999, costRef);\n        System.out.println(costRef[0]);\n        sc.close();\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -7.86750388215296e-05, -0.0001573438785271719, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -7.497983460780233e-05, -0.01529007125645876, -0.0004396664153318852, 0.0, -0.00034517052699811757, -0.0007117837085388601, -1.704678